{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-3","name":"司会","text":"さ～て！　今日もはじまりました\r\n『できちゃう？　クッキング！』","trans":"好～了！　今天也开始了\n“能做出来吗？　烹饪时间！”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"司会","text":"今日のゲストは～？","trans":"今天的嘉宾是～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"アイドル","text":"こんにちは～♡\r\n新人アイドルの──","trans":"你好～♡\n是新人偶像的——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"アイドル","text":"ごめんなさ～い！\r\n上手に出来なかったかもですぅ～","trans":"对不起～！\n好像做得不太成功呢～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"司会","text":"これ、僕食べなきゃダメ？\r\n中々面白いことになってるけども","trans":"这个，我非得吃吗？\n虽然看着还挺有意思的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"司会","text":"今日のゲストは、この方！","trans":"今天的嘉宾，就是这位！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"俳優","text":"お招きいただき、ありがとうございます\r\n俳優の──","trans":"感谢您的邀请\n我是演员——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-24","name":"司会","text":"これはまた……\r\nプロ並みの出来じゃないですか！","trans":"这可真是……\n不是专业级的水准吗！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-25","name":"俳優","text":"ハハハ、実はちょっと\r\n『コソ練』というやつをしてきましてね","trans":"哈哈哈，其实我稍微\n做了一下所谓的“偷偷练习”呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-31","name":"off","text":"『できちゃう？　クッキング』\r\n出演につきまして","trans":"关于“能做出来吗？　烹饪时间”\n的出演","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-32","name":"off","text":"幽谷霧子様に作っていただくのは\r\n『八宝菜』となっております","trans":"由幽谷雾子负责制作的是\n“八宝菜”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-33","name":"off","text":"どのように作っていただくかは\r\nご出演者様次第ですので、何卒よろしくお願いいたします","trans":"具体怎么做\n全凭出演者自己决定，请多指教","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010020","name":"霧子","text":"（ちゃんと……\r\nやらなきゃ……）","trans":"（必须……\n好好做……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010030","name":"霧子","text":"ママ……\r\n今日の……夕飯……","trans":"妈妈……\n今天的……晚饭……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010040","name":"霧子","text":"わたし……\r\n作っていい……？","trans":"我……\n可以来做吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010050","name":"霧子","text":"（まず……\r\nにんじんの……皮……）","trans":"（首先……\n胡萝卜的……皮……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010060","name":"霧子","text":"（白菜は……半分にして……）","trans":"（白菜要……切成两半……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010070","name":"霧子","text":"（３センチの……幅に……）","trans":"（切成3厘米……宽……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010080","name":"霧子","text":"（たけのこは……\r\n薄切り……）","trans":"（竹笋……\n切成薄片……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010090","name":"霧子","text":"あ……","trans":"啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010100","name":"霧子","text":"（きくらげ……\r\n戻さなきゃ……）","trans":"（木耳……\n得泡开……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010120","name":"霧子","text":"（お肉と……エビに……\r\n下味をつけて……）","trans":"（肉和……虾……\n先腌一下……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010140","name":"霧子","text":"炒めます……","trans":"炒……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010160","name":"霧子","text":"（重い……）","trans":"（好重……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010170","name":"霧子","text":"（お肉……色……\r\n変わったから……）","trans":"（肉……颜色……\n变了……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010180","name":"霧子","text":"お野菜……\r\n入れます……","trans":"蔬菜……\n放进去……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010190","name":"霧子","text":"（しんなり……）","trans":"（变软了……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010200","name":"霧子","text":"（お酒……大さじ１……）","trans":"（酒……1大勺……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010210","name":"霧子","text":"（お砂糖……大さじ２分の１……）","trans":"（糖……二分之一大勺……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010220","name":"霧子","text":"（お醤油……大さじ１……）","trans":"（酱油……1大勺……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010230","name":"霧子","text":"（お水……）","trans":"（水……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010250","name":"霧子","text":"（ちょっと……\r\n美味しくない……）","trans":"（有点……\n不好吃……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010270","name":"霧子","text":"時間……\r\nかかりすぎてて……","trans":"时间……\n花得太久了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010300","name":"恋鐘","text":"霧子、どがんしたと～？","trans":"雾子，怎么了～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010310","name":"霧子","text":"『恋鐘ちゃんに……\r\n助けて……ほしくて……』","trans":"“想请恋钟……\n帮帮我……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010320","name":"恋鐘","text":"大丈夫！？\r\nなんでも言うてくれてよかよ！","trans":"没事吧！？\n什么都可以跟我说哦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010330","name":"霧子","text":"『ありがとう……』","trans":"“谢谢……”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010340","name":"霧子","text":"一週間……だけ……","trans":"就一个星期……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010350","name":"霧子","text":"わたしの……\r\n先生に……","trans":"我的……\n老师……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010360","name":"霧子","text":"なって……\r\nくれないかな……？","trans":"能不能……\n当一下……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010370","name":"恋鐘","text":"『先生……？』","trans":"“老师……？”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008028010380","name":"霧子","text":"うん……\r\n先生……","trans":"嗯……\n老师……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}